        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARWIN, Ornate Windsor Knob with Carre Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Windsor Knob with Carre Rose has a fancy, design that really highlights the beauty and quality of Grandeur's finish colors. The Ornate Windsor Knob with Carre Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CARWIN Carre Rosette with Windsor Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Knobset with Carre Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARWIN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262391\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARWIN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Windsor Knob with Carre Rose",
                "description": "The Windsor Knob with Carre Rose has a fancy, design that really highlights the beauty and quality of Grandeur's finish colors. The Ornate Windsor Knob with Carre Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most pre-drilled doors.",
